  "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
  "instance_name": "mapping_1",
  "label": "The woman lounging in the shopping cart is mapped as the person taking the broken dishwasher back to Walmart.",
  "description": "The text 'when your dishwasher is broken so you take it back to walmart to get a new one' implies that the woman in the image represents the person experiencing this situation. Her relaxed, casual posture in the shopping cart, while eating a hot dog, is humorously projected onto the role of someone handling a household appliance problem. The visual of her lounging is used to analogically represent the person who is dealing with the broken dishwasher and going to Walmart for a replacement. This is a clear case of analogical mapping where the visual entity (the woman) is mapped onto the textual entity (the person in the scenario).",
  "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface",
